      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Due to the positivity of Ce, a sufficient condition for the derivative above being positive is T ′(t) > 0 and T ′(t) ≤1. The set",
      "bbox": [
        55.439998626708984,
        604.5956420898438,
