    },
    {
      "text": "of such sequence is not empty, and a trivial example is T(t) = t + δ for some parameter δ > 0, which satisfies 1) and is",
      "bbox": [
        55.439998626708984,
        618.48291015625,
        541.4381103515625,
        627.5488891601562
